{"seq":2,"slug":"silent-push-background","title":"静默推送与后台唤醒","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/implementation/silent-push-background","wordCount":1484,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"静默推送与后台唤醒\">静默推送与后台唤醒</h1><p>静默推送（Silent Push）是不展示任何可见通知、仅唤醒应用在后台执行短暂任务的技术。它的核心价值在于数据同步——在用户无感知的情况下提前拉取新内容、更新本地缓存、同步配置变更，使用户下次打开 app 时立即看到最新状态，而非等待加载。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>content-available</strong>（iOS）：APNs payload 中的标志位，触发后台唤醒而非展示通知</li>\n<li><strong>Data Message</strong>（FCM）：仅含 <code>data</code> 字段的消息，始终由应用代码处理，不被系统自动展示</li>\n<li><strong>执行预算（Budget）</strong>：iOS 对静默推送的频率限制，系统根据 app 使用频率动态分配</li>\n<li><strong>Doze 模式</strong>（Android）：系统省电机制，会延迟 normal priority 消息的投递</li>\n<li><strong>App Standby Bucket</strong>（Android）：根据 app 使用频率分档（Active/Working/Frequent/Rare），影响后台任务调度</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"ios-静默推送机制\">iOS 静默推送机制</h2><p>iOS 通过 <code>content-available</code> 标志触发静默推送。系统收到含该标志的远程通知时，会在后台唤醒 app（或启动已终止的 app），调用 <code>application(_:didReceiveRemoteNotification:fetchCompletionHandler:)</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"触发条件\">触发条件</h3><p>payload 中设置 <code>&quot;content-available&quot;: 1</code>，且不包含 <code>alert</code>、<code>badge</code>、<code>sound</code>（或这些字段为空）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;aps&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;content-available&quot;: 1&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;sync_type&quot;: &quot;new_messages&quot;,&#10;  &quot;last_sync_ts&quot;: 1721270400&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"aps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"content-available\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sync_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"new_messages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"last_sync_ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1721270400</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对应的 <code>apns-push-type</code> header 必须设为 <code>background</code>，<code>apns-priority</code> 必须设为 <code>5</code>（设为 10 会被 APNs 拒绝）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"系统限制与预算\">系统限制与预算</h3><p>iOS 对静默推送实施了严格的执行预算（budget）管理：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>限制维度</th>\n<th>具体约束</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>频率</td>\n<td>约 2-3 次/小时</td>\n<td>系统动态调整，非固定值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行时间</td>\n<td>最多 30 秒</td>\n<td>超时自动终止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电量状态</td>\n<td>低电量时大幅削减</td>\n<td>可能完全不唤醒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络状态</td>\n<td>Wi-Fi 下更宽松</td>\n<td>蜂窝网络下更保守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>app 使用频率</td>\n<td>高频 app 配额更多</td>\n<td>用户很少打开的 app 配额极低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键注意：用户通过系统设置关闭 Background App Refresh 时，静默推送仍会被接收（系统层行为），但 app 不一定被唤醒（取决于 iOS 版本和电量状态）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"执行最佳实践\">执行最佳实践</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func application(_ application: UIApplication,&#10;                 didReceiveRemoteNotification userInfo: [AnyHashable: Any],&#10;                 fetchCompletionHandler completionHandler: @escaping (UIBackgroundFetchResult) -&gt; Void) {&#10;    guard let syncType = userInfo[&quot;sync_type&quot;] as? String else {&#10;        completionHandler(.noData)&#10;        return&#10;    }&#10;    performBackgroundSync(type: syncType) { hasNewData in&#10;        completionHandler(hasNewData ? .newData : .noData)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> application</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> application: UIApplication,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                 didReceiveRemoteNotification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userInfo: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AnyHashable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                 fetchCompletionHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> completionHandler: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@escaping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (UIBackgroundFetchResult) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    guard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> syncType </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userInfo[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sync_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        completionHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.noData)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    performBackgroundSync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: syncType) { hasNewData </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        completionHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(hasNewData </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .newData </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .noData)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>必须在 30 秒内调用 <code>completionHandler</code>——调用结果会影响系统对该 app 的后续唤醒预算：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>.newData</code>：告知系统本次唤醒有价值，有助于维持后续配额</li>\n<li><code>.noData</code>：无新数据，系统可能降低后续唤醒频率</li>\n<li><code>.failed</code>：任务失败，系统可能降低配额</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"fcm-data-message\">FCM Data Message</h2><p>FCM 的 data message 是 Android 侧实现静默推送的主要方式。与 notification message 的核心区别：data message 始终由应用代码处理，不会被系统自动展示。</p>\n<h3 id=\"前台与后台行为对比\">前台与后台行为对比</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[FCM 接收消息] --&gt; B{消息类型?}&#10;    B --&gt;|notification message| C{App 状态?}&#10;    B --&gt;|data message| D[始终触发 onMessageReceived]&#10;    C --&gt;|前台| E[触发 onMessageReceived]&#10;    C --&gt;|后台/终止| F[系统自动展示通知&lt;br/&gt;data 在用户点击后传递]&#10;    D --&gt; G[应用完全控制:&lt;br/&gt;决定是否展示通知/同步数据/静默处理]\">graph TD\n    A[FCM 接收消息] --&gt; B{消息类型?}\n    B --&gt;|notification message| C{App 状态?}\n    B --&gt;|data message| D[始终触发 onMessageReceived]\n    C --&gt;|前台| E[触发 onMessageReceived]\n    C --&gt;|后台/终止| F[系统自动展示通知&lt;br/&gt;data 在用户点击后传递]\n    D --&gt; G[应用完全控制:&lt;br/&gt;决定是否展示通知/同步数据/静默处理]</pre><h3 id=\"data-message-的后台唤醒\">Data Message 的后台唤醒</h3><p>Android 的后台限制使得 data message 的可靠唤醒需要配合 high priority：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;message&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;token&quot;: &quot;...&quot;,&#10;    &quot;data&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;sync_type&quot;: &quot;config_update&quot;,&#10;      &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.3.1&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;android&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;priority&quot;: &quot;high&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"token\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"data\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"sync_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"config_update\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2.3.1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"android\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Priority</th>\n<th>Doze 模式行为</th>\n<th>App Standby Bucket 影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>high</code></td>\n<td>立即投递（消耗 FCM 高优先级配额）</td>\n<td>Active/Working Set 正常; Rare 可能延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>normal</code></td>\n<td>批量延迟投递（等下一个维护窗口）</td>\n<td>受 Bucket 严格约束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>高优先级配额</strong>：Google 不公布具体数字，但滥用 high priority 发送不唤醒用户操作的消息会导致该 app 的 high priority 消息被自动降级为 normal。</p>\n<h3 id=\"workmanager-集成模式\">WorkManager 集成模式</h3><p>对于需要超过 10 分钟执行时间的后台同步任务，应使用 data message 触发 WorkManager：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"override fun onMessageReceived(message: RemoteMessage) {&#10;    val syncRequest = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&lt;DataSyncWorker&gt;()&#10;        .setConstraints(Constraints.Builder()&#10;            .setRequiredNetworkType(NetworkType.CONNECTED)&#10;            .build())&#10;        .setInputData(workDataOf(&quot;sync_type&quot; to message.data[&quot;sync_type&quot;]))&#10;        .build()&#10;    WorkManager.getInstance(this).enqueueUniqueWork(&#10;        &quot;push_sync&quot;, ExistingWorkPolicy.REPLACE, syncRequest&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>override fun onMessageReceived(message: RemoteMessage) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val syncRequest = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&#x3C;DataSyncWorker>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .setConstraints(Constraints.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .setRequiredNetworkType(NetworkType.CONNECTED)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .setInputData(workDataOf(\"sync_type\" to message.data[\"sync_type\"]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    WorkManager.getInstance(this).enqueueUniqueWork(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"push_sync\", ExistingWorkPolicy.REPLACE, syncRequest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"hms-数据消息\">HMS 数据消息</h2><p>HMS Push Kit 的数据消息（data message）机制与 FCM 类似：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;message&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;token&quot;: [&quot;...&quot;],&#10;    &quot;data&quot;: &quot;{\\&quot;sync_type\\&quot;:\\&quot;content_update\\&quot;,\\&quot;ts\\&quot;:1721270400}&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"token\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"data\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">sync_type</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">content_update</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ts</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:1721270400}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 HMS 的 <code>data</code> 字段值必须是<strong>字符串</strong>（JSON 序列化后的字符串），不是 JSON 对象——这与 FCM 的 <code>data</code>（key-value map of strings）有所不同。</p>\n<p>HMS 在 HarmonyOS 设备上支持&quot;分布式消息接收&quot;（<code>distributedMessageReceive</code>）——当手机接收到数据消息时，可以同步唤醒同账号下的平板或手表执行相应的数据同步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"后台唤醒的可靠性挑战\">后台唤醒的可靠性挑战</h2><p>静默推送在理想条件下是高效的后台同步手段，但其可靠性受多重因素制约：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>主要限制因素</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>iOS</td>\n<td>执行预算 + Background App Refresh</td>\n<td>低频使用 app 可能数小时不被唤醒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Android (GMS)</td>\n<td>Doze + App Standby Bucket</td>\n<td>Rare bucket 的 app 一天仅 1 次网络窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Android (国产ROM)</td>\n<td>厂商后台管理</td>\n<td>被&quot;清理&quot;后完全无法收到 data message</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HarmonyOS</td>\n<td>系统资源调度</td>\n<td>低优先级应用受限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>因此，静默推送不能作为时效性要求高的数据同步的唯一手段。可靠的架构通常将静默推送与以下机制组合使用：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>App 前台时的主动拉取</strong>：打开 app 时始终与服务端校验最新状态</li>\n<li><strong>本地定时同步</strong>：通过 <a href=\"local-scheduled-notifications\">本地通知与定时调度</a> 或 BackgroundTasks（iOS）/ WorkManager（Android）定期触发</li>\n<li><strong>增量同步设计</strong>：每次同步只拉取 delta，减少单次同步的数据量和时间消耗</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"静默推送的合规边界\">静默推送的合规边界</h2><p>Apple 和 Google 对静默推送的使用有明确的合规要求：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Apple</strong>：静默推送必须用于合法的内容更新，不得用于持续追踪用户位置或执行挖矿等计算密集型任务。违规会导致 APNs 大幅削减该 app 的推送配额甚至完全封禁。</li>\n<li><strong>Google</strong>：FCM high priority data message 必须用于&quot;对用户可见的操作产生结果&quot;的场景。如果高优先级消息触发的后台工作对用户完全不可见，Google 可能将该 app 的所有高优先级消息降级。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些约束意味着后台同步的场景选择必须审慎：合法场景包括新消息预取、邮件同步、日历更新；违规场景包括静默广告加载、后台日志批量上报、静默进行 A/B 实验数据收集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>静默推送是后台数据同步的高效工具，但其可靠性受系统省电策略、执行预算和网络条件多重制约。生产架构中不应将静默推送作为唯一的同步手段，而应与主动拉取、定时任务（WorkManager/BGTaskScheduler）组合使用，形成多层保障的数据同步体系。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"静默推送与后台唤醒","id":"静默推送与后台唤醒"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS 静默推送机制","id":"ios-静默推送机制"},{"level":3,"text":"触发条件","id":"触发条件"},{"level":3,"text":"系统限制与预算","id":"系统限制与预算"},{"level":3,"text":"执行最佳实践","id":"执行最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"FCM Data Message","id":"fcm-data-message"},{"level":3,"text":"前台与后台行为对比","id":"前台与后台行为对比"},{"level":3,"text":"Data Message 的后台唤醒","id":"data-message-的后台唤醒"},{"level":3,"text":"WorkManager 集成模式","id":"workmanager-集成模式"},{"level":2,"text":"HMS 数据消息","id":"hms-数据消息"},{"level":2,"text":"后台唤醒的可靠性挑战","id":"后台唤醒的可靠性挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"静默推送的合规边界","id":"静默推送的合规边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"富媒体通知与交互","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/implementation/rich-notification-media"},"next":{"title":"本地通知与定时调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/implementation/local-scheduled-notifications"}}